# Docker context là root repository; chỉ giữ manifest, TypeScript config và source HTTP.
*
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/
!packages/common/
!packages/common/**
!services/
!services/media-service/
!services/media-service/package.json
!services/media-service/package-lock.json
!services/media-service/tsconfig.json
!services/media-service/src/
!services/media-service/src/**

# Không đưa dependency/output/secret local vào build context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!services/media-service/.env.example

# Lambda, script triển khai và tài liệu có lifecycle riêng, không cần cho HTTP image.
services/media-service/lambda
services/media-service/scripts
services/media-service/docs
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/*.log
